Bind Npc 19002 Zone 21
Quest 117 "Antidote"
    Journal "I promised [Middle Man] Berrett that I would find and provide three Apples of Moradon to him."
    Collect 3 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 31

Rewards
    Give 500000 experience

On offer
    Say "Damn... Big trouble...\nKNIGHT!! Can you please, please help me? I'm in dire straits here."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You need Apple of Moradon to make the antidote. Hunt the Pincers Scorpion and collect the poison in its tail."

On in_progress
    Say "To save them all, we need at least <font color=@#660066@>three Apples of Moradon</font>. Please take courage and find them for me"

On ready
    Say "Master, Ok, you've got enough Apple of Moradon for Berret. Let's get it back to him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thanks. Thank you so much. Really, you saved everyone. We really are thankful."
